{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43510","headline":"金谷园花发怀古 · 无名氏","name":"金谷园花发怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风生梓泽，迟景映花林。\n欲问当时事，因伤此日心。\n繁华人已殁，桃李意何深。\n涧咽歌声在，云归盖影沈。\n地形同万古，笑价失千金。\n遗迹应无限，芳菲不可寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}